  "body": "A sweeping optimization of the whole project (cast: **Mandare**). The framework's rules are unchanged and re-proven; the presentation and structural complexity are streamlined. **Net: 236 files changed, ~81,800 lines deleted, ~2,200 added**, across 10 commits that each leave the repo green.\n\n## The spore is THE artifact\n- A spore PNG may now carry a **germ** \u2014 the complete AppAI build document (the former egg schema) \u2014 plus a build note any coding agent can read to grow the app with or without Mantle installed (`spore.pack_germ`, `mantle spore pack`). Generated germ spores ship in `examples/spores/`.\n- **One birth door:** `mantle hatch <spore.png|germ.json>` absorbs `hatch-spore`; `egg.py` folds into the hatchery (`validate_germ`/`load_germ`, accepting both `mantle-germ-v1` and legacy `mantle-egg-v1`).\n- **Assimilation emits a spore:** `mantle assimilate <host> --spore=out.png` condenses the read-only dissection into the host's germ spore. A graft is a spore aimed at a host (`load_graft` accepts graft-germ spores).\n\n## Rebirth simplified\n- One **heirloom law** (carried or immune-logged, never silent), one carry rule for both heirloom bands; `vault.py` folds into the Reproduction organ. On-disk formats unchanged \u2014 ancestors stay readable.\n\n## Dead weight removed\n- The 9.9 MB vendored duplicate of the entire repo inside the Hermes addon (the loader now resolves `MANTLE_ADDON_RUNTIME_ROOT` \u2192 install-time `runtime/` copy \u2192 the repo checkout; vendoring happens at install time).\n- The self-referential optimization-audit layer: `optimize_audit.py` (3,991 lines), `documents/refinement/`, and 21 unregistered meta-invariants.\n- Scratch notes, the superseded NotepadNext lifecycle zip, and fourteen merged documentation files.\n\n## Docs consolidated\n- One reading order: **README \u2192 `documents/PRIMER.md` \u2192 `mantle teach`** (FIELD_GUIDE is its declared prose mirror). PRIMER absorbs the Doctrine, Organism Lens, and Positioning; ARCHITECTURE.md absorbs the architecture note and Part 1/2 narratives; REPRODUCTION.md is the canonical reproduction + rebirth doctrine; the VCW guide absorbs the anatomical atlas and compliance tiers.\n- Contradictions resolved: invariant counts are now **derived, never hardcoded** (the doctor's inverted docs-vs-code gate fails any doc that hardcodes one); the Grimoire is consistently 2.0 with a scope banner naming its Mantle-binding sections (\u00a77/\u00a79).\n- CLI dispatch is table-driven; underscore aliases are derived.\n\n## Security laws unchanged and re-proven\nKeys minted at birth, never derived from a spore (SPORE-1); foreign conversation ingested as INFERRED through Senses; the Stage-1 gate mandatory on every birth path; do-no-harm census on every graft; heirloom carry across rebirth. New invariant **SPORE-3** proves the full germ \u2192 spore \u2192 hatch \u2192 certified-body round trip.\n\n## Verification\n- `python -m mantle check`: **14/14 gates green** (incl. spore purity + VCW conformance)\n- `python -m mantle prove`: **94/94 invariants green**\n- `python -m mantle teach`: all 18 chapters proven\n- Hermes addon: **132 tests OK** + **11/11 containment** rows\n- Browser smokes: notepad, live-agent, and calculator suites green locally; the two CDN-dependent demo pages were syntax-verified (the sandbox could not reach unpkg \u2014 CI's Demo Smoke workflow exercises them fully)\n- No-Pillow install: stdlib hatch path works; PNG operations refuse loudly\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_017nZVpKX3sxMREac5PaZ87n",
